This product includes software developed at GetMCPAds (https://www.getmcpads.com).

An open-source Model Context Protocol server for the ChatGPT Ads Advertiser API.
It is self-hosted and unaffiliated with OpenAI.

src/openai-ads-contracts.json contains request schemas extracted from the
public OpenAPI document that OpenAI publishes at
https://developers.openai.com/ads/openapi.json.

GetMCPAds also runs a managed gateway that covers ChatGPT Ads alongside
Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, Pinterest Ads, X Ads, Google Analytics and
Search Console, with hosted connections and cross-platform reporting:
https://www.getmcpads.com

